<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-21T18:48:20.119Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:48:20 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army and the Rapid Support Forces have again used drones to strike civilian sites, most recently hitting a market in Abyei and killing more than 150 people. UN-mediated peace talks have resumed in an effort to halt the drone war that is worsening the humanitarian crisis. The UN Security Council is holding a live session on the conflict’s spread, the impact of drones and hunger. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/sudan-drone-strike-kills-around-150-in-abyei-market/a-79716587?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168638&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/19/us-migrants-deportation-ukraine-sudan&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168612&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/21/world/africa/sudan-drone-strikes.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQZHdPdHJvbUlsMVFnY29MWXpHZHZJQjN6dXRoVW5vVmp0Qng5ZjItd25wZ014Y29EMGFOWDY1b1JWdV9lRTcyS21leHVzNUQ3aTRDMU5wLTlqUXhoYXRuTkNjZUVVTjF1dFYyMzNLM0tieU9VNWhVUzJILTdWT3MzQ3VUc3Y5cGkxVjhpN3hXcGZielpTU0xITVo4eVpnRUU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxQN3U4cjBHVHNDQU90aGd6WTVBMHdRMkROQVpUMWFNdnBJS1ExY1dmdjlUdmxJTGswSFJqMnhRVnMwM0VPcHg3S0dDcldBaXo4a0preXY0SFBWZGdySDNRd25FTW5kTWg2THBYanhSNEFDUWlZMno2MzVOMEN5UVV6RUtScnU2X1hVTzduZDQ4dGNyUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTE9UWHVqTVFHdXhLR0daemtVazNhcGVrMmpYY1BsbjJCODdxMVhkMXNUdDkyTEx2LTdqMVZWc3NDX2ZWVkZncmJfQ2V1X0FseWhzbXUtY1hfSUtQS19tNzNuWU45QWlWQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE1aUzlOMDItVk14NWcxVDRMMDh3NVhSakt5N2ozd2tZUHo5NmVNT3M5ODFNSGJDTEhxRWFPd09ESzN6V2dzOVVfYmgySFFFVk9VRXZDNzVNQzlSMDNQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
